Description: desktop cockpit for coding agents and their Docker Compose stacks
 x3ro deck runs Claude Code, Codex or any CLI agent in each of your
 checkouts, collects permission prompts and questions in one place,
 and shows each checkout's Docker Compose stack, quick commands and
 pull request.
